def _allow_socket(*args, **_kwargs) -> bool:
    """Allow socket operations on non-blocking sockets.

    asyncio drives its transports with non-blocking sockets (including its own
    self-pipe), and non-blocking calls never block the event loop, so they must
    be permitted. Only genuinely blocking sockets are flagged.
